      info        : "The system must require passwords to contain no more than three consecutive repeating characters.

GROUP ID: V-216096RULE ID: SV-216096r959010

Complex passwords can reduce the likelihood of success of automated password-guessing attacks."
      solution    : "The root role is required.pfedit /etc/default/passwd

Locate the line containing:

MAXREPEATS

Change the line to read:

MAXREPEATS=3"
